URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/81-drifters-5/
SUMMARY:81 DRIFTERS
DESCRIPTION:\nHailing from the scenic landscapes of Appalachia\, the 81 Dri
 fters weave a tapestry of sounds ranging from singer-songwriter originals 
 to bluegrass\, western swing\, old country\, and classic rock. The Western
  North Carolina string band from Asheville NC led by multi-instrumentalist
 s and songwriters Nick Colavito and Kristina Miller.\n\n\n\nThe 81 Drifter
 s write and perform original music pulling influences from Bluegrass\, Gyp
 sy Jazz\, Swing\, Folk\, and Americana to put their own flavor to traditio
 nal music.\n\n\n\nFind their first two singles "Moved to the City" and "He
 aded on My Way" on all streaming platforms!\n\n\n\nJoin us for their summe
 r return to Jack of the Wood! Music from 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the d
 oor!\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/gF9YkqL0QMY?si=ZbXn1IYHLmnsmz1Q\n\n\n\n\n\n
 https://youtu.be/c5po116zksU\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/PFkRVjTh7b4?si=4f
 H0hTs-ockRtmdp\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/04/81Drifters_2024-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
