URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/shed-house-trio-featuring-darren-nich
 olson/
SUMMARY:The Shedhouse Trio featuring Darren Nicholson
DESCRIPTION:\nA GRAMMY nominee and winner of 13 International Bluegrass Mus
 ic Association awards\, Darren Nicholson has taken his own brand of mounta
 in music around the world. A regular for years on the Grand Ole Opry out o
 f Nashville Tennessee\, and a founding member of acclaimed bluegrass group
  Balsam Range\, Darren now spends his time recording\, writing new songs &
 amp\; performing.\n\n\n\nYou can catch Darren almost every week sharing th
 e music he loves somewhere\, traveling both nationally and internationally
  — as a solo artist\, with his own Darren Nicholson Band\, or in collabo
 ration with other musicians . . . . . . including his pals\, THE SHED HOUS
 E TRIO —&nbsp\;BRADY WALLEN (banjo &amp\; vocals)\, SARAH GRIFFIN (bass 
 &amp\; vocals)\, and AVERY WELTER (guitar &amp\; vocals).\n\n\n\nMusic 8:3
 0-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/ed8sKWA3CCQ?s
 i=rjF1JGqa7dCv61yW\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/5oUJ-AP-20U?si=l_R6ciyESeMS
 gy3N\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/8QlDK2gCsLk?si=ZBXy3C8Y2Hjycp0I\n\n\n\n\n
 \nhttps://youtu.be/Rj6adBzDYDw?si=i2BBGVyzdMPdo128\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/05/darrennicholson1-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
