SUMMARY:Utility Players
DESCRIPTION:\nBlues\, Funk\, Rock\, and Country all in one group of amazing
  musicians. Come check out Drew Matulich and his company of talented Ashev
 ille musicians as they weave their way through the genres you love. This e
 vening will be especially focused on blues—with Drew on guitar\, Stig St
 iglets on bass\, Peter Mencher on drums\, and Ben Balmer on harmonica—so
  it's not a show you'll want to miss!!!\n\n\n\nmusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cove
 r at the door.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
